<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Bear Stearns cuts Millennium.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Bear Stearns cuts Millennium.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns cuts Millennium Chemicals Inc to neutral from attractive, a source at the brokerage said.  </p>
<p>-- Analyst Jeff Cianci was not immediately available to comment.</p>
